,"source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","source_revision":8735632,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p011","person_id":"6m0_ze7_hl0","quote":"元鼎六年冬，樓船將軍將精卒先陷尋陜，破石門，得越船粟，因推而前，挫越鋒，以數萬人待伏波。伏波將軍將罪人，道遠，會期後，與樓船會乃有千餘人，遂俱進。樓船居前，至番禺。建德、嘉皆城守。樓船自擇便處，居東南面；伏波居西北面。會暮，樓船攻敗越人，縱火燒城。越素聞伏波名，日暮，不知其兵多少。伏波乃為營，遣使者招降者，賜印，復縱令相招。樓船力攻燒敵，反驅而入伏波營中。犁旦，城中皆降伏波。呂嘉、建德已夜與其屬數百人亡入海，以船西去。伏波又因問所得降者貴人，以知呂嘉所之，遣人追之。以其故校尉司馬蘇弘得建德，封為海常侯；越郎都稽得嘉，封為臨蔡侯。"}]}],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r062","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r062-c06","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null},{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r062-c00","column":0,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"臨蔡。","source_row":63,"source_column":1,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r062","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r062-c00","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null,"citation_role":"native_table_title_reference"},{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r062-c01","column":1,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"以故南越郎聞漢兵破番禺，為伏波得南越相呂嘉功侯。","source_row":63,"source_column":2,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r062","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r062-c01","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null,"citation_role":"native_table_title_reference"},{"id":"shiji-022-t1-r097-c01","column":1,"rowspan":1,"c